# Vercel CLI deploy context allowlist for the standalone `reincarnated-glance`
# project (Root Directory = glance/app).
#
# WHY THIS FILE EXISTS: Vercel CLI deploys do NOT honor .gitignore. Deploying
# from the meta-repo root would otherwise upload ~4GB of untracked heavy dirs
# (godot-sqlite vendored addon, duskweaver media-gen output, node_modules).
# The Glance build needs two trees plus one derived VIEW asset:
#   - glance/        (the app + its deterministic parser)
#   - canonical/     (the parser's ONLY input: the 4 trackers + 2 Matt queues)
#   - the RULED V1.2 plane SVG (Glance v1.10 §7.7) — a DB-derived view that
#     scripts/stage-assets.mjs copies onto /atlas at build. It is the SINGLE
#     source of truth (gandalf-owned); we upload the one canonical file rather
#     than vendor a duplicate copy into the glance tree (a duplicate would drift
#     — the exact failure this project fights). The PARSER's read set is
#     UNCHANGED (canonical/** only); this asset is consumed only by asset-staging.
# Everything else is excluded.
#
# Pattern: ignore everything, then negate the trees the build reads.
# NOTE: the parser's git best-effort reads (repo_sha/last_commit) will return
# null in this context — that is by design (try/catch, never fatal). The
# provenance stamp's source_commit is likewise git-best-effort (stage-assets).

*

!glance
!glance/**
!canonical
!canonical/**

# The one derived view asset (see header) — un-ignore the path to just this file.
!agentic_orchestration
!agentic_orchestration/gandalf
!agentic_orchestration/gandalf/views
!agentic_orchestration/gandalf/views/v1-plane
!agentic_orchestration/gandalf/views/v1-plane/plane_view_v1_2_stratified.svg

# Within the two kept trees, still drop derived/heavy artifacts:
glance/app/node_modules
glance/app/dist
glance/app/.vercel
glance/app/.env.local
